@meta
id: 01-09
title: Replace mode, the overwriting one
chapter: 01
type: lesson
skills: mode-awareness, esc, survival-motion
par: 17
minutes: 4
vscode: the Insert key, if you have ever pressed it on purpose
open: deploy.md

@brief
There is a fourth door. `R` — capital R — puts you in REPLACE mode, where
what you type overwrites what is already there instead of pushing it
along. The indicator at the bottom reads `-- REPLACE --`.

It earns its keep where the text is aligned: version numbers, dates,
status codes, anything in a column. Insert mode would shift everything to
the right of the cursor and break the alignment. Replace mode leaves the
line exactly as long as it was.

deploy.md says the service is on 2.4.0. It went out as 2.5.1 this
morning. Fix the version line without disturbing the columns.

@keys
| `R` | replace mode — typing overwrites |
| `Esc` | back to normal mode |
| `$` | last character of the line |
| `h` | one character left |

@hints
The version is the last thing on its line, so `$` gets you close. You need
to be on the character where the *first* difference starts.
--
From the end of `2.4.0`, two `h` presses put you on the `4`. Everything
from there rightwards is going to be typed over.
--
`R` then `5.1` overwrites three characters with three characters. `Esc`
when you are done — replace mode does not end on its own.

@solution
    j j $ h h R 5 . 1 <Esc> :wq<Enter>

Note what did not happen: no selecting, no deleting, no retyping of the
parts that were already right. You put the cursor at the first wrong
character and typed the correct text over the top.

Replace mode is a mode, not a one-shot. It keeps overwriting until you
press `Esc`, which is the mistake people make with it — they fix three
characters, carry on typing a comment, and quietly eat the rest of the
line. For a single character there is a better tool coming in chapter 3.
For a fixed-width field like this one, `R` is exactly right.

@start deploy.md
# Deploy log  payments-api

Version   2.4.0
Released  2026-05-11
Window    30 days

@expected deploy.md
# Deploy log  payments-api

Version   2.5.1
Released  2026-05-11
Window    30 days
